# Denali Gravity — Remediation Map

> **Promoted (PSR-2b):** formerly `temp/DENALI_GRAVITY_REMEDIATION_MAP.md` (rev 2).
> Canonical program narrative remains [`denali-gravity-remediation.mdoc`](./denali-gravity-remediation.mdoc).
> This file is the detailed phased map / hostile-review evidence — not ignored scratch.

> **Purpose:** Precise phased path to fix **Denali gravity** — only Denali has production shape; Urban/starter/finance are stubs/fixtures; second product today ≈ package clone, not config.
>
> **Scope of this file:** Planning map only. No code. **Rev 2** incorporates hostile review (§R).
>
> This promoted map does not replace `guard-docs` for protected package commits.

---

## 0. Problem statement (frozen)

| Claim | Evidence (2026-07-31) | Verdict |
| ----- | --------------------- | ------- |
| Only Denali has production shape | `guestConformance.productionTier: "certified"` + `memberApp: true`; ~541 ts/tsx, ~44 121 LOC; ~162 package exports; manifest ~18 KB / ~59 top keys | **True** |
| Urban is stub | `productionTier: "stub"`; ~71 files / ~3 816 LOC (~8.6% of Denali); no `ui/`, `wizard/`, `finance/`, `booking/`, `rules/`, `field-registry/` | **True** |
| starter is stub/scaffold | ~14 files / ~526 LOC; wizard host only; `aliasCatalogWorkspaceType: "denali"` | **True** |
| finance-ws* are fixtures | ~7–10 files each; `workspaceFinance.supported: false` / registryOnly; tour-write no-op stubs | **True** |
| Second product ≈ clone, not config | Urban mirrors Denali with ~35 parallel stems (`denali-*` → `urban-*`); shared module dirs only; zero Urban-only product layers | **True** |

### Two paths that must not be conflated

| Path | Meaning | Status |
| ---- | ------- | ------ |
| **A — Second club (tenant)** | New tenant on **same** certified workspace type (`denali`) | Mostly ready (P10 + Phase H) |
| **B — Second product family** | New workspace type without cloning Denali package tree | **Open gap — this map** |

This map remediates **Path B**. Path A stays operational and must not be blocked by B work.

