### DG-1 — P-lib for guest catalog + registration (collapse clones)

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| Duration | 2–3 weeks |
| Focus | W-level rename clones in catalog HTTP + registration services |
| First consumer | **guest-club** (or spike) → then **urban** |
| Denali | **Not** peeled in DG-1 (wait DG-3 P0) |

**What DG-1 is**

- Extract shared helpers used by ≥2 workspaces into **P-lib** (ports already in SDK where possible).
- Rewire first consumer handlers to call P-lib; delete dead parallel helpers in that package.
- Keep `handleGet*` / `handlePost*` exports on workspace `handlerPackage` (codegen unchanged).

**What DG-1 is not**

- Not moving handlers into `apps/api`
- Not rebuilding registration-flow compose (already shared)
- Not breaking starter alias
- Not certifying anyone
- Not lifting Denali `ui/` / finance / booking

**Lift candidates (from mirror stems) → P-lib**

| Pattern | Target |
| ------- | ------ |
| Catalog list/detail service guts | P-lib + W ports for store/exposure |
| Registration service guts | P-lib + W schema/policy hooks |
| Owner assert / public auth resolve helpers | P-lib or SDK contract helpers |
| Repeated error class boilerplate | shared error factories (optional) |

**Stay in W:** route manifest prefixes, workspace-specific schemas, intake step components, JSON-LD builders.

**Exit criteria**

- [x] P-lib package/module exists under `workspace-sdk` `src/http` (+ auth owner factory); **no** `pluginId ===` product branches (product-neutral contract green)
- [x] Consumer #1 (guest-club) uses P-lib JSON helpers; urban+denali consume P-lib for auth/catalog list/guards (full registration/catalog *domain* peel still DG-3)
- [x] Parallel stem metric **recorded** (DG-1.8): exact basename overlap under `src/{http,auth,tours,catalog,exposure}` Urban↔Denali = **16** (method documented in mdoc; stem *deletion* is DG-3/DG-6, not DG-1 boilerplate peel)
- [x] Path A smoke checklist green (Denali catalog + register) on fast-track — SMK-MKT-03 green (2026-07-31 DG-4.7.1); D01 /me member list still open
- [x] Doc-first: `docs/architecture/denali-gravity-remediation.mdoc` (DG-1.1…1.7 slices)
- [x] Urban rewired as consumer #2 on P-lib (still stub / Phase 7 proof) — DG-1.x thin wiring

**Anti-goals:** Denali peel; starter alias break; finance; full gates without YES.

