1. Neutral/platform wizard field catalog (or starter-owned minimal catalog) so starter **stops aliasing Denali**.
2. Ensure manifest can express G1 profile deltas (presentation, intake, landing, SEO, prefixes) for city vs mountain **without** hand app branches.
