### DG-3 — Peel Denali onto P-lib (certified path preserved)

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| Duration | 3–4 weeks phased |
| Gate | DG-1 consumer #1 green before **P0** |

**Peel priority**

| Pri | Module | When | Action |
| --- | ------ | ---- | ------ |
| P0 | catalog/http/registration shared guts | After DG-1 | Denali handlers → P-lib; delete duplicate impl |
| P0 | tour-write/publish/exposure binders that are generic | After or with P0 | Contracts + thin adapters |
| P1 | Wizard host glue still generic | ∥ OK | Continue `createPlatformWizardHostHooks` adoption |
| P1 | Denali-named API seeds/bootstrap | ∥ OK | manifest `devBootstrap` / pluginId maps only |
| P2 | ui, rules, field-registry, finance, booking, photos, composites | Never in DG-3 | Stay W |

**Ratchet:** shared capability → P-contract/P-lib first; never only under `workspace-denali`.

**Exit criteria**

- [x] Denali guest HTTP paths use P-lib (no large private duplicate of Urban/guest-club guts) — DG-3.0…3.6
- [ ] Before/after count of non-generated `denali` hits in `apps/api/src` recorded if seeds touched
- [ ] Path A + Denali certified smokes fast-track green
- [ ] No new shared logic added only in Denali package

