### DG-F — Finance registration neutrality (optional track)

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| When | Only if product #2 needs finance **or** platform wants Denali-unhooked finance mounts |
| Prerequisite | Prefer after G2; never blocks G1 |

**Work:** any `workspaceFinance.supported: true` workspace (or platform capability pack) can declare shared `@app-tour/finance-http` route group — Denali not sole registrar.

**Exit:** finance onboarding doc no longer says “routes owned by Denali manifest” as hard dependency for monorepo second product.

**Non-goal:** rewriting Denali ledger policy; finance-ws* remain fixtures until packs replace them.

