## 8. Verification policy (all DG phases)

Default:

```text
pnpm run pre-commit:fast
pnpm run guard:import-boundary   # when boundaries touched
pnpm run test:changed            # when behavior changed and inspection insufficient
```

**Path A regression checklist** (DG-1 / DG-3 P0 PRs):

- Denali public catalog list/detail reachable for smoke tenant
- Denali portal registration happy path (or equivalent API/contract test if browser out of scope)
- If finance files touched: Denali finance summary route still dispatches

Forbidden without explicit Architect **YES** in chat:

- `phase-5:gate`, `phase-6:gate`, `test:full`, `ci:integrity`, full monorepo `pnpm build` / `pnpm test`

See `docs/dev/tiered-testing.md`.

